{"type":"action","name":"Liquid Body","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A sepsis serpent can effortlessly reshape their body to easily flow through narrow crevices. They can move at their full Speed through any opening large enough to fit their head.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"NBeDlRuEl1f5Ed1W","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Motion Sense","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A sepsis serpent can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"65tbvN3yTBFoqX6x","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Fangs","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["agile","finesse","unarmed"]},"damageRolls":{"Z5RDQxZHMJBglPpB":{"damage":"2d6+8","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":17},"attackEffects":{"value":["sepsis-serpent-venom"]}},"_id":"WYsSZ6x4DE6pmH9R","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Venom Spray","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["poison","range-increment-30"]},"damageRolls":{"RKDxBCJkalCZvGxE":{"damage":"3d6","damageType":"poison","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":17},"attackEffects":{"value":["sepsis-serpent-venom"]}},"_id":"k6AVoWinxglx8z0D","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Sepsis Serpent Venom","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:23]</p><p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[4d6[poison]] damage and enfeebled 1 (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[4d6[poison]] damage, enfeebled 1 (1 round) and @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1}</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"iWxbJsKaJmDpLlc1","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Venomous Reproduction","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>If a creature dies while under the effect of Septic Invasion, the creature's blood coagulates and forms a new sepsis serpent 1 minute after its death. This newborn serpent's size is Tiny and they can't use Septic Invasion. Additionally, the new serpent is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} and can't reduce or remove the condition in any way for 1 week.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"McIy4XskU3clyPjH","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Activate Invader","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The sepsis serpent activates a clone from Septic Invasion that is residing inside a creature within 30 feet. The creature is exposed to sepsis serpent venom, after which it is temporarily immune to Activate Invader for 1 minute. On a successful save (but not a critical success), the creature takes @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage or the poison damage for their current stage of septic serpent venom, whichever is greater.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"rAGfSSX7jMFa4a80","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Septic Invasion","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The sepsis serpent damages a creature with their fangs Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The sepsis serpent releases a minuscule copy of themselves into the bloodstream of a living creature. The copy remains dormant inside the creature until sepsis serpent activates it. The copy becomes inert and dies if it is not activated for 24 hours. The host or an adjacent creature can spend 1 manipulate action and use a healer's toolkit to attempt a @Check[medicine|dc:24] check to remove the copy with the following results.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The septic invasion is removed without harm to the host.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The septic invasion is removed, and the host takes @Damage[1d6[slashing]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The removal fails and the host takes @Damage[1d6[slashing]] damage.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The removal fails miserably. The host takes @Damage[1d6[slashing]] damage and the copy activates, as if the sepsis serpent had used Activate Invader.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"gSQRfxGEQwDZY1sk","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":2700000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}